WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
The public site points people toward a clear path: watch the walkthrough, review trust and pricing, then create a dedicated trial without waiting for a live demo.

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
The client experience is mobile-friendly, structured, and cleaner than email attachments or PDF packets, with progress, consent, and field guidance built in.

00:14.000 --> 00:21.000
Once a submission lands, the advisor dashboard shows progress, status, follow-up context, and exports instead of burying the handoff in an inbox.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
The privacy queue handles data access, deletion, correction, legal hold, and retention review workflows, and approved deletions push records into redaction instead of ad hoc edits.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
The trust center packages the security overview, WISP summary, incident response summary, vendor list, recovery summary, SOC readiness page, and DPA and MSA baselines in one place.

00:35.000 --> 00:42.000
The self-serve trial flow provisions a dedicated workspace, returns the onboarding link, advisor dashboard, login, and temporary credentials, and points the buyer to the walkthrough and trust docs.
